@fact letter.kept_open
about: The Alderman's letter to Hester Gannet, after Low Night: keep 4471/G open; further loss is expected in the gale, and one open claim is cheaper than two.
against: trust 20
by: reading

@fact loss3.mother
about: In the gale, Mother was put out.
by: the night

@fact loss3.lamp
about: In the gale, a lamp the town had chosen to keep alight was put out by hand.
by: the night

